OL,3,GNEWSATwo-legged delivery robot unveiled
OL,4,Ain Tech Town
OL,5,
OL,6,FA two-legged delivery robot has taken
OL,7,Fto the streets of Barnsley for a
OL,8,F"European-first" trial.
OL,10,FBarnsley was chosen to host Iris as
OL,11,Fpart of its designation as the UK's
OL,12,Ffirst Tech Town, which will see AI
OL,13,Futilised in public services, schools,
OL,14,Fbusinesses and the NHS.
OL,16,FIris was developed by Japanese company
OL,17,FRefined Robotics, which is running the
OL,18,Ftrial in collaboration with parcel
OL,19,Fdelivery group Evri.
OL,23,APub: 28-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
