OL,3,GNEWSATwo-legged delivery robot unveiled
OL,4,Ain Tech Town
OL,5,
OL,6,FRefined Robotics founder Nick Hafner
OL,7,Fsaid: "Barnsley is really trying to
OL,8,Fshow how innovative the city can be,
OL,9,Fand be a testing ground for these types
OL,10,Fof new technologies."
